r=#3f8f43;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=ERmany;startArrow=ERone;endFill=0;startFill=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#14261a;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t26" target="t295"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e325" value="posts cash-out" style="edgeStyle=entityRelationEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;strokeColor=#3f8f43;strokeWidth=1.5;endArrow=ERmany;startArrow=ERone;endFill=0;startFill=0;fontSize=10;fontColor=#14261a;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t204" target="t270"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="z326" value="LEGEND

PK  primary key      FK  foreign key
UQ  unique constraint

Solid line  = declared relationship
Dashed line = logical link resolved
                       in the service layer" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4FFE9;strokeColor=#14493B;fontSize=11;fontColor=#14261a;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="880" width="300" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="z327" value="MONEY INVARIANTS

1.  finance_ledger.amount is always ≥ 0. Direction comes from category + source_type,
     never from a negative number.
2.  daily_settlement moves DEBT only. to_loan + to_advance + to_overdraw + payable = earned.
3.  Cash leaves the estate in exactly one place: sending a disbursement_batch.
4.  Postings are idempotent on (source_type, source_id)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E6;strokeColor=#B7791F;fontSize=11;fontColor=#14261a;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="880" width="620" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="z328" value="FOREIGN KEYS ARE PLAIN COLUMNS

Modelled as BIGINT, not JPA relations.
Names are resolved in the service layer
(workerMap, zoneMap).

Deliberate: keeps query behaviour explicit
and avoids unintended lazy loading." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4FFE9;strokeColor=#3f8f43;fontSize=11;fontColor=#14261a;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;arcSize=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1120" y="880" width="300" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>